parameters.description:
Optional. Limits results by event state. Send the name or its number:
UPCOMING (1) — published events that have not ended, or ended less than one day ago;
HISTORY (2) — published events that ended more than one day ago;
DRAFT (3) — events not yet published.
"Ended" uses the end date (the start date when there is none) in the event's own time zone.
Omit to return events in every state, drafts included.
